  {
    "id": 3007002010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おーい！　おっはよーまみみーん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "んー……？\r\nあっ、三峰かぁ。おはよー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あんなに遠くから、よくわかったねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "わかるよー、同じユニットの大事な仲間なんだからさぁ\r\n三峰アイのサーチ力から逃れられると思わないことだねっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっやだやめて無言はしんどい",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "冗談は置いとくとしてもさ、まみみんは服のおかげで、\r\n後ろ姿からしてオンリーワンだもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "見つけやすいよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そういうことなら、三峰だって遠くからでもわかるけどねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ありゃ、やっぱり？\r\n三峰、アイドルオーラで目立っちゃう感じ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やーまいったなぁ、\r\n三峰ったらもうそこまでのアイドルになっちゃったかー",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "これもアンティーカのおかげだなぁ、うんうん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうは言ってないケド",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010140",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……まみみん、さっきから手厳しいよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "私、しつこいのは苦手なんでー",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007002010170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それにー、三峰を見つけやすい理由だって、\r\n私と同じで──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700201/3007002010170"
